06:15.340 --> 06:15.980
Maestro!

06:16.780 --> 06:17.440
Kinunana!

06:18.240 --> 06:20.840
Anya tikang runaan abilin itilinteg?

06:21.680 --> 06:23.080
Insungbat ni Jesus

06:23.080 --> 06:25.920
