06:25.920 --> 06:27.460
iti amin apusom

06:27.460 --> 06:30.100
iti amin akararwam

06:30.100 --> 06:31.940
ken iti amin

06:31.940 --> 06:32.800
apanunot mo

06:32.800 --> 06:35.240
Daytoy ti umuna

06:35.240 --> 06:36.800
ken kang runaan abilin

06:36.800 --> 06:40.060
Ti maika dua akang runaan abilin

06:40.060 --> 06:41.460
umasping iti umuna

06:41.460 --> 06:43.980
Ayatem ti padam

06:43.980 --> 06:45.940
atao akas itibagim

06:45.940 --> 06:48.520
Dagitoy dua abilin

06:48.520 --> 06:50.000
ti pagbatayan ti entero

06:50.000 --> 06:51.240
alinteg ni Moises

06:51.240 --> 06:52.700
ken ti panursuro

06:53.080 --> 06:54.500
